{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13221460","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13221460","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1322146001:1":{"text":"这位先生，请问最近是有圣骑士前来雪松镇吗？","source_cn":"这位先生，请问最近是有圣骑士前来雪松镇吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x410F5EF61BEBA1EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322146002:1":{"text":"啊，是的是的！昨天来的，是位叫……呃，对了，名叫特弥希娅的女士，骑着一匹高头大马，可威武了！","source_cn":"啊，是的是的！昨天来的，是位叫……呃，对了，名叫特弥希...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87DC0850BBB49EDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322146003:1":{"text":"竟然是特弥希娅！她一定是来协助白山修道院的圣职者们处理这次事件的。","source_cn":"竟然是特弥希娅！她一定是来协助白山修道院的圣职者们处理...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E3647A561BE84CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322146004:1":{"text":"也不知道怎么回事，圣骑士大人说咱们白山的那些活死人不是恶魔的手下，反而是过去和恶魔战斗的战士！","source_cn":"也不知道怎么回事，圣骑士大人说咱们白山的那些活死人不是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31F7BC5BC087177F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322146005:1":{"text":"艾雅在上，这到底是真的还是假的？！真是把我给弄糊涂了……","source_cn":"艾雅在上，这到底是真的还是假的？！真是把我给弄糊涂了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1489D3E230588EC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","